{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterBruhatOrder","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterBruhatOrder","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterBruhat","lean:module:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterDeletion"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterBruhatOrder.not_bruhatLe_of_length_lt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterBruhatOrder.not_bruhatLe_of_length_lt","kind":"theorem","line":109,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterBruhatOrder.lean#L109-L114","doc":"Contrapositive form, convenient downstream: a strictly longer element is never below. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterBruhatOrder.bruhatLe_one_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterBruhatOrder.bruhatLe_one_iff","kind":"theorem","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterBruhatOrder.lean#L101-L107","doc":"**`w ≤ 1` iff `w = 1`.** The identity is the bottom of the order and nothing sits below it. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterBruhatOrder.bruhatLe_antisymm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterBruhatOrder.bruhatLe_antisymm","kind":"theorem","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterBruhatOrder.lean#L97-L99","doc":"**Antisymmetry** — the first of `CoxeterBruhat`'s four deferred properties. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterBruhatOrder.eq_of_bruhatLe_of_length_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterBruhatOrder.eq_of_bruhatLe_of_length_le","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterBruhatOrder.lean#L83-L95","doc":"**`u ≤ w` with `ℓ(w) ≤ ℓ(u)` forces `u = w`.**\n\nA length squeeze and nothing else: `ℓ(u) ≤ |ω'| ≤ |ω| = ℓ(w) ≤ ℓ(u)` pins `|ω'| = |ω|`, and a\nsublist of the same length as its host **is** its host. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterBruhatOrder.bruhatLe_reduced_witness","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterBruhatOrder.bruhatLe_reduced_witness","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterBruhatOrder.lean#L71-L79","doc":"**A `BruhatLe` witness may be taken reduced.** A subword of a reduced word need not itself be\nreduced; `exists_reduced_sublist'` replaces it by a reduced sublist with the same product, which\nis still a sublist of the original by transitivity of `List.Sublist`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}